00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:26.950
'cause I won't see that either.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:30.740
And the chat function has been disabled.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:35.740
So the way it's gonna work
is that Ethan is going to

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:39.480
give his presentation
for about 30, 35 minutes.

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:42.210
And then we will open
