00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.290
I'd also like to thank in NSL Cova

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.020
for all of the arrangements that were made

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.050
in setting up and publicizing the lecture.

